{"4693780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trouble in Our Skies", "steam_appid": 4693780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsisana was the greatest city in the sky... until &quot;The Blackout.&quot; CEO Otto Spekter vanishes along with most of the city's governing force, leaving a vacuum filled by mysterious digital viruses and unidentified mechanical threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gifted engineer and overseer of Sector Delta, Nyla Spekter had resigned Tsisana to its destruction, but then her long-dormant caregiver robot, Lammy, is suddenly revived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there's anything or anyone who can make a difference in these broken skies, Nyla believes it's Lammy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of Trouble in Our Skies is heavily inspired by Armored Core 6: Fires of Rubicon, but with an odd (and rather wholesome) twist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission, the 'Reclamation,' involves multitasking in the heat of chaotic circumstances, constantly switching between your 'Cleaner' and 'Catcher' modes to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > turn trash into fuel, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >subdue threats,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve environmental puzzles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >convert 'badbots' and 'sadbots' into functional servitors to help you with the Reclamation...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you investigate the suspicious deterioration of Tsisana, you will face stronger and more intimidating foes, challenging your mastery of the 'Reclamation.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsisana was the greatest city in the sky... until &quot;The Blackout.&quot; CEO Otto Spekter vanishes along with most of the city's governing force, leaving a vacuum filled by mysterious digital viruses and unidentified mechanical threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gifted engineer and overseer of Sector Delta, Nyla Spekter had resigned Tsisana to its destruction, but then her long-dormant caregiver robot, Lammy, is suddenly revived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there's anything or anyone who can make a difference in these broken skies, Nyla believes it's Lammy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of Trouble in Our Skies is heavily inspired by Armored Core 6: Fires of Rubicon, but with an odd (and rather wholesome) twist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission, the 'Reclamation,' involves multitasking in the heat of chaotic circumstances, constantly switching between your 'Cleaner' and 'Catcher' modes to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > turn trash into fuel, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >subdue threats,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve environmental puzzles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >convert 'badbots' and 'sadbots' into functional servitors to help you with the Reclamation...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you investigate the suspicious deterioration of Tsisana, you will face stronger and more intimidating foes, challenging your mastery of the 'Reclamation.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lammy is a mechanical caregiver bot that has been long dormant but is suddenly revived admist the chaotic remnants of the once-greatest city in the sky. He must now take up the task of finding out the source of such far-reaching destruction and fixing it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693780/a8e095ae77931dc9a52664b32ddcfa3c394e85bb/header.jpg?t=1779530904", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693780/af39bda6d10e6336e93fee40c8f90cadbfdf26aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779530904", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693780/af39bda6d10e6336e93fee40c8f90cadbfdf26aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779530904", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 / GeForce GT 710<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["EmberLight Stories"], "publishers": ["EmberLight Stories"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/46